WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:37.980 --> 01:39.900
Mandragora petals...

01:41.480 --> 01:44.240
Lapis Lazuli bathed in the
light of a full moon...

01:45.740 --> 01:48.240
Turmeric leaves trod
upon by a kitten...

01:49.870 --> 01:52.410
Mix these with care...

01:52.410 --> 01:53.870
This is great!

01:53.870 --> 01:58.180
This'll make a potion to cure
Vanilla of her black heart!

01:58.180 --> 01:59.340
Oh yeah!

01:59.340 --> 02:00.460
All right!

02:00.460 --> 02:01.670
You're naive.

02:02.130 --> 02:05.840
Strong magic is required
to use this potion.

02:05.840 --> 02:07.570
Chocolat can't use it at present.

02:07.890 --> 02:08.800
It can't be.

02:08.800 --> 02:11.100
Then Saule or I will use it.

02:11.100 --> 02:13.310
Plus, we can get help
from Robin-sensei.

02:13.770 --> 02:18.270
Tragically, no one but
Chocolat can use it.

02:20.110 --> 02:22.280
How can that be?!

02:22.280 --> 02:24.650
The reason will soon become clear.

02:24.650 --> 02:27.240
In any case, Chocolat Meilleure...

02:27.700 --> 02:31.660
only you can use this
potion to save Vanilla.

02:32.990 --> 02:34.770
Only me...

02:35.080 --> 02:39.080
Hey, you just said my magic
wasn't good enough!

02:39.080 --> 02:41.540
Come back here with
some silverberries.

02:41.540 --> 02:42.640
Silverberries?

02:43.090 --> 02:46.260
Yes. Only the power of those berries...

02:46.260 --> 02:48.760
will allow you to use the potion.

02:49.340 --> 02:52.760
Only the... silverberries...?

02:52.760 --> 02:56.140
But I've never heard of silverberries.

02:56.140 --> 02:58.480
Tell me where to find them!

02:59.190 --> 03:00.070
"Please..."

03:01.310 --> 03:02.730
Tell me, please.

03:10.200 --> 03:13.080
She has a very astute nose.

03:13.080 --> 03:16.040
She'll track the scent of
silverberries for you.

03:16.040 --> 03:16.590
Chocolat,

03:17.040 --> 03:18.960
you'll be riding on her.

03:19.670 --> 03:23.170
Get on her back,
and transmit your thoughts...

03:23.840 --> 03:26.630
of wanting to find
the silverberries.

03:28.590 --> 03:29.760
I understand.

03:32.600 --> 03:34.760
Then let's hurry up and go!

03:34.760 --> 03:35.510
Yeah!

03:36.640 --> 03:40.520
Cirus, please take me to, where
the silverberries are!

03:49.530 --> 03:53.030
Frozen Memories, Pierre's Past.

04:13.370 --> 04:15.680
Chocolat, are you okay?

04:15.680 --> 04:17.520
M-more or less.

04:17.520 --> 04:19.850
Put me down for "less"...

04:20.690 --> 04:23.230
We've slowed down.

04:23.230 --> 04:26.520
Does that mean we're getting
closer to the silverberries?

04:26.520 --> 04:28.650
That's gotta be it, Houx-sama!

04:33.160 --> 04:36.530
Huh? I feel like I've seen
this landscape before.

04:36.530 --> 04:37.910
Have you been here before?

04:37.910 --> 04:38.740
It's...

04:39.880 --> 04:41.250
Ginger Village!

04:41.250 --> 04:42.500
Ginger Village?

04:42.500 --> 04:44.760
It really is Ginger Village!

04:47.300 --> 04:49.070
This really takes me back...

04:49.420 --> 04:53.930
Gramps used to bring me
here to play all the time!

04:56.760 --> 04:59.100
It smells like ginger.

04:59.100 --> 05:01.320
No surprise there. Look...

05:01.640 --> 05:04.080
the whole village is surrounded
by ginger fields.

05:04.900 --> 05:05.940
Chocolat?

05:06.610 --> 05:10.560
Well, if it isn't Chocolat!

05:10.860 --> 05:13.930
Uncle Beignet! Aunt Mousse!

05:17.160 --> 05:18.280
Hi there!

05:18.280 --> 05:20.330
It is you, Chocolat.

05:20.330 --> 05:23.460
My my, look how you've grown.

05:24.040 --> 05:29.790
Surely this isn't the same girl who dug up all the
ginger in the village and threw it at people?

05:30.420 --> 05:31.460
You said it!

05:31.460 --> 05:33.550
And surely this isn't the same girl...

05:33.550 --> 05:37.770
who poured festival grape jelly on
herself to play "ghost," either?

05:39.100 --> 05:41.060
Can't say I remember that at all.

05:41.060 --> 05:44.440
You don't? I never forget.

05:44.440 --> 05:45.560
Neither do I.

05:46.100 --> 05:48.530
Those sound like Chocolat
stories to me.

05:48.860 --> 05:50.020
That's for sure.

05:49.770 --> 05:50.480
Yeah!

05:50.020 --> 05:50.480
Totally sounds like her.

05:52.360 --> 05:54.950
By the way, how's Corne doing?

05:54.950 --> 05:57.070
Gramps? Same as always.

05:57.070 --> 06:01.870
To think you've gone from
that ginger incident,

06:01.870 --> 06:05.300
to being a Queen candidate...

06:06.160 --> 06:08.430
Yeah, let's not talk about
that anymore.

06:12.960 --> 06:14.490
A black wind?

06:14.920 --> 06:18.010
Lately, there've been a lot
of days like today where...

06:18.010 --> 06:22.110
the wind from the Cuillere Forest
carries the presence of Noir.

06:22.110 --> 06:23.700
The presence of Noir?

06:24.390 --> 06:27.980
The far side of the forest
is Ogre territory.

06:27.980 --> 06:32.840
Their energy, once in hibernation, is now increasing.

06:33.480 --> 06:34.830
And that's not all.

06:36.240 --> 06:38.330
Take a look at the sky.

06:40.700 --> 06:41.450
What's that?

06:41.450 --> 06:42.280
A castle?

06:42.280 --> 06:43.540
It's huge!

06:43.540 --> 06:44.950
And scary.

06:44.950 --> 06:46.290
It's the Ogres' castle.

06:48.120 --> 06:49.630
It shows up in the sky...

06:49.630 --> 06:52.300
when the atmosphere gets
distorted like this.

06:52.750 --> 06:55.420
This never used to happen.

06:55.420 --> 06:56.520
Not at all.

06:56.970 --> 06:58.180
This can only mean...

06:58.180 --> 07:01.140
that the Ogres' power
is getting stronger!

07:01.140 --> 07:01.520
Yeah.

07:02.510 --> 07:04.060
What is it, Cirus?

07:05.430 --> 07:07.730
Hey, there's nothing but
fields over there...!

07:11.110 --> 07:12.540
The forest?

07:12.860 --> 07:16.280
You're saying there's
silverberries in that forest?

07:17.780 --> 07:22.030
Surely you don't intend to go
into the Cuillere Forest?

07:22.030 --> 07:22.870
I'm going.

07:22.870 --> 07:23.670
Out of the question!

07:24.080 --> 07:29.170
Its nothing like the place
you used to play in.

07:29.170 --> 07:31.550
A black haze hangs in the air...

07:31.880 --> 07:35.840
and it's a dangerous place that
nobody goes to anymore.

07:35.840 --> 07:37.300
A dangerous place?

07:37.300 --> 07:38.420
Chocolat!

07:39.800 --> 07:42.180
You mustn't go there, Chocolat!

07:42.180 --> 07:45.100
Even if it's dangerous, I have to go.

07:45.100 --> 07:47.730
A friend of mine's in big trouble...

07:48.390 --> 07:50.350
and I'm the only one
who can save her!

07:50.940 --> 07:52.740
That's why I'm going.

07:53.560 --> 07:57.650
You really have grown, Chocolat.

07:57.650 --> 07:59.740
Into a fine Queen Candidate, that is.

08:00.240 --> 08:02.030
Ah yes..

08:02.030 --> 08:04.910
Take these ginger cookies with you.

08:06.790 --> 08:08.410
They smell good.

08:08.410 --> 08:09.710
Thank you!

08:09.710 --> 08:13.210
You always devoured
them with such glee.

08:13.750 --> 08:15.720
Because they were just that good!

08:19.130 --> 08:21.220
Take care, Chocolat.

08:21.220 --> 08:22.090
I will.

08:22.090 --> 08:23.430
That goes for you three, too.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.300
Okay.

08:24.300 --> 08:27.930
Thanks again, Uncle Beignet,
Aunt Mousse!

08:38.370 --> 08:41.280
You've come this far,
so I hope you're ready.

08:41.280 --> 08:41.780
Yeah.

08:54.790 --> 08:55.670
It's true.

08:56.620 --> 08:58.380
The forest really has changed.

08:59.340 --> 09:01.720
It never used to be like this.

09:02.090 --> 09:05.140
I'm cold, Houx-sama.

09:05.140 --> 09:05.640
Yeah.

09:06.100 --> 09:08.350
It must be the black haze.

09:08.890 --> 09:11.270
It's much denser
than I thought it'd be.

09:11.270 --> 09:11.860
Sure is.

09:12.480 --> 09:16.110
Are we really going to find
silverberries in a place like this?

09:16.110 --> 09:17.320
Ah, Cirus!

09:17.320 --> 09:18.070
Chocolat!

09:21.940 --> 09:22.700
Cirus!

09:23.030 --> 09:24.070
That way!

09:24.070 --> 09:24.610
Okay!

09:26.780 --> 09:27.370
Chocolat!

09:40.750 --> 09:42.090
Cirus...

09:42.970 --> 09:44.130
where'd you go?

09:44.130 --> 09:45.300
Cirus!

09:46.180 --> 09:48.400
Cirus!!

09:54.050 --> 09:56.860
Duke? Houx? Saule?

09:57.520 --> 09:59.360
Waffle? Bii?

10:00.570 --> 10:02.440
I got separated from them...

10:08.160 --> 10:12.090
I came here a lot
when I was younger.

10:18.170 --> 10:19.750
No doubt about it.

10:19.750 --> 10:22.300
This forest was on the
Memory Screens.

10:23.130 --> 10:27.630
I was playing here with a boy
who looked just like Pierre.

10:28.930 --> 10:30.300
Yet, why...

10:31.050 --> 10:33.260
can't I remember any
more than that?

10:34.100 --> 10:36.890
It's as if my memories are frozen...

10:39.270 --> 10:40.440
Pierre!

10:44.110 --> 10:46.870
Cho... Chocolat!

11:01.460 --> 11:02.720
Pierre...

11:03.210 --> 11:04.050
Chocolat...

11:05.590 --> 11:07.260
T-thank you...

11:07.880 --> 11:10.130
for saving me back on Mt. Piman.

11:10.720 --> 11:12.010
Don't get me wrong.

11:12.640 --> 11:14.930
I didn't save you because
I wanted to.

11:14.930 --> 11:17.230
But you really did save me!

11:19.390 --> 11:22.310
Hey, do you remember
this forest, too?

11:22.310 --> 11:24.570
This is the same forest...

11:24.570 --> 11:26.860
that was on the Memory Screens.

11:27.360 --> 11:31.080
And those two kids were me and
you when we were younger.

11:32.410 --> 11:33.950
A familiar scent...

11:35.150 --> 11:38.840
It's sweet... and just a bit pungent.

11:39.210 --> 11:42.880
Yes, it smells like ginger cookies.

11:42.880 --> 11:43.590
That's because...

11:44.000 --> 11:46.420
I brought these ginger cookies
from Aunt Mousse.

11:46.420 --> 11:49.310
I always brought them when
I came to play in the forest.

11:50.220 --> 11:53.560
I feel like I've eaten them
before... with someone...

11:54.350 --> 11:56.060
But I can't remember!

11:56.560 --> 11:58.810
It's as if my memories are frozen...

11:58.810 --> 11:59.640
Pierre!

12:00.310 --> 12:02.230
Are you all right, Pierre?

12:07.160 --> 12:08.230
It's magic...

12:08.740 --> 12:10.620
magic that's preventing
us from remembering.

12:11.700 --> 12:12.820
I want to remember...

12:13.740 --> 12:16.950
what I saw on the Memory Screens.

12:18.000 --> 12:19.910
Was it really you and me?

12:20.540 --> 12:22.120
Did we meet in the past?

12:26.170 --> 12:27.680
If we combine our magic,

12:28.420 --> 12:31.170
it might bring our memories back.

12:36.100 --> 12:36.720
Okay!

12:39.180 --> 12:39.850
Wand!

12:41.730 --> 12:43.850
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

12:44.690 --> 12:46.440
Memoire d'Air!

13:02.830 --> 13:03.790
It's me!

13:05.130 --> 13:05.880
And me...

13:07.880 --> 13:08.920
How cute!

13:08.920 --> 13:10.880
They're called pinkberries.

13:10.880 --> 13:11.710
They're delicious.

13:12.670 --> 13:13.430
Here.

13:17.180 --> 13:18.770
Wow, they are!

13:18.770 --> 13:19.600
See?

13:19.600 --> 13:23.020
Oh yeah, I brought ginger
cookies again.

13:24.440 --> 13:25.350
I remember...

13:26.350 --> 13:30.980
I always looked forward to Gramps
taking me to Ginger Village.

13:31.490 --> 13:34.930
I went to the forest, and played
with a slightly mysterious boy.

13:35.530 --> 13:39.080
He knew a lot, and was
good at magic.

13:39.080 --> 13:40.910
That boy had the cutest smile...

13:41.870 --> 13:43.290
I remember too.

13:43.290 --> 13:47.680
A girl who occasionally came
down from the capital.

13:48.380 --> 13:51.420
She was full of energy,
prettier than any flower,

13:51.960 --> 13:54.170
and had a smile like sunlight.

14:15.110 --> 14:16.780
Ah, there he is!

14:16.780 --> 14:20.030
The one Glace-sama was
so interested in...

14:20.030 --> 14:22.130
And what strong magical
energy he has!

14:22.540 --> 14:23.950
Who... what are you?

14:25.620 --> 14:27.420
Such a strong spirit!

14:27.420 --> 14:29.290
He will make a fine Prince for us.

14:34.510 --> 14:36.100
Pierre!

14:36.420 --> 14:38.220
Memories, glaze over with ice.

14:38.220 --> 14:40.510
Along with this forest!

14:40.510 --> 14:42.350
Memories, glaze over with ice.

14:42.350 --> 14:44.070
Along with this forest!

15:02.080 --> 15:04.160
Are you okay, Pierre?

15:04.620 --> 15:06.250
You saw it, didn't you?

15:06.250 --> 15:09.790
You were a normal
Magical World boy,

15:09.790 --> 15:12.140
but the Ogres kidnapped you.

15:12.790 --> 15:16.720
I know they implanted a black
heart in you, just like Vanilla's.

15:16.720 --> 15:19.640
You do have two hearts after all!

15:19.970 --> 15:21.720
You're wrong! There is no conflict.

15:23.310 --> 15:24.770
Didn't you see what happened?

15:25.180 --> 15:27.430
Pierre, you were kidnapped!

15:27.430 --> 15:31.060
Even if that were true,
that's ancient history now.

15:31.060 --> 15:31.770
Pierre...

15:32.690 --> 15:34.860
It's irrelevant to me now.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.740
I guess it is.

15:38.570 --> 15:41.320
Ancient history might
not matter anymore.

15:41.320 --> 15:42.160
It might not...

15:42.700 --> 15:44.500
But the present does matter, right?

15:45.700 --> 15:49.790
At first, I thought the Ogres
were simply "bad."

15:49.790 --> 15:52.760
But after talking to Queen Candy,

15:52.760 --> 15:55.090
and reading Mama's diary,

15:55.090 --> 15:58.050
I started seeing the bad parts
about Le Royaume...

15:59.050 --> 16:02.630
and how much the
Ogres had suffered.

16:03.510 --> 16:05.020
And then there's you, Pierre.

16:05.510 --> 16:09.560
You did lots of bad things
to me and Vanilla,

16:10.100 --> 16:13.820
but I saw so much of your
gentler side, too.

16:13.820 --> 16:15.690
That kindness wasn't fake.

16:16.190 --> 16:18.410
It absolutely, positively wasn't fake!

16:18.410 --> 16:20.990
I was faking it,
in order to deceive you...

16:22.030 --> 16:23.290
I'm telling you it was all a lie!

16:23.780 --> 16:27.590
I think the Ogres and
Le Royaume can get along.

16:27.910 --> 16:29.410
No chance, that'll never...

16:30.120 --> 16:32.790
That's what Mama and
Queen Candy wished for, too.

16:33.250 --> 16:38.090
So if Vanilla and I combine our
powers, and add yours to that,

16:38.090 --> 16:41.050
someday the Ogres and
Le Royaume can...

16:41.050 --> 16:43.300
It's pointless. Impossible.

16:43.300 --> 16:45.140
That person will never allow it.

16:45.140 --> 16:46.100
"That person"?

16:47.180 --> 16:50.060
No one can ever bridge the gap...

16:50.060 --> 16:52.480
between the Ogres
and Le Royaume.

16:52.480 --> 16:53.190
Pierre!

16:57.360 --> 16:58.270
Pierre...

16:59.980 --> 17:01.690
But I believe in it.

17:02.280 --> 17:06.070
Whether Vanilla or I become Queen...

17:06.620 --> 17:07.540
I'm sure that...

17:12.960 --> 17:13.790
Cirus!

17:14.420 --> 17:16.250
Ah, Cirus!

17:16.250 --> 17:17.260
And everyone else!

17:17.590 --> 17:19.170
Thank goodness you weren't hurt.

17:19.170 --> 17:20.590
I was so worried!

17:20.590 --> 17:22.010
Honestly...

17:23.760 --> 17:24.930
Sorry!

17:24.930 --> 17:28.390
We gotta hurry and find those
silverberries, don't we?

17:31.770 --> 17:33.390
Cirus, what is it?

17:34.190 --> 17:35.020
Cirus!

17:39.230 --> 17:41.020
Good girl, Cirus!

17:42.940 --> 17:44.650
So these are silverberries?

17:45.110 --> 17:47.160
Take them out, Chocolat.

17:47.160 --> 17:47.660
Yeah.

17:48.490 --> 17:50.790
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

17:50.790 --> 17:52.710
Ice... melt!

17:55.290 --> 17:57.710
Eh? My magic's not working...

17:57.710 --> 17:58.500
What the hell?

17:59.090 --> 18:00.510
Feuille Epee!

18:03.970 --> 18:05.050
What?

18:05.050 --> 18:07.340
That's probably Ogre Ice.

18:07.340 --> 18:10.560
Eh? Then how can we pick
them, Houx-sama?

18:10.560 --> 18:12.010
I'll have to pick them the hard way.

18:16.440 --> 18:17.770
Chocolat!

18:17.770 --> 18:18.860
Let me do that.

18:18.860 --> 18:21.190
Nope, I'm doing this.

18:21.190 --> 18:22.360
But...

18:22.360 --> 18:23.150
It's just that...

18:24.190 --> 18:29.490
I get the feeling that if
I don't do it, no one can.

18:29.490 --> 18:32.410
Otherwise, I won't be
able to save Vanilla.

18:59.150 --> 19:00.350
Chocolat...

19:01.270 --> 19:04.090
Chocolat is really incredible.

19:19.330 --> 19:20.380
I got them!

19:20.380 --> 19:21.500
You did it!

19:22.880 --> 19:27.590
These silverberries are the pinkberries that got frozen by the Ogre Ice.

19:34.470 --> 19:36.850
You're right. Let's hurry back.

19:36.850 --> 19:37.770
Yeah.

19:50.170 --> 19:50.660
Here.

19:51.280 --> 19:53.910
Good work.
The potion is now ready.

19:55.580 --> 19:57.540
Now, take out your wand.

19:57.540 --> 19:57.990
Yes.

19:59.410 --> 20:00.620
Hold on tight.

20:03.630 --> 20:06.380
That which has slumbered in
the forlorn forest of ice...

20:07.840 --> 20:11.310
along with my secret potion, become a mighty magical energy!

20:44.800 --> 20:46.080
There you go.

20:46.080 --> 20:47.630
It is now imbued...

20:47.630 --> 20:50.720
with the power to remove
Vanilla's black heart.

20:51.340 --> 20:52.170
Vanilla...

20:53.380 --> 20:54.970
Thank you, Amber!

20:55.510 --> 20:57.140
You really are a nice person!

20:57.930 --> 21:00.360
And just what part of me is "nice"?

21:00.360 --> 21:02.600
Now, if you could just improve
your hospitality...

21:02.600 --> 21:04.520
That's quite enough,
get going, will you?!

21:06.230 --> 21:08.860
You should be able to pass
through the Moon Door.

21:08.860 --> 21:10.980
All right! Let's roll out!

21:13.090 --> 21:14.500
Huh? Waffle?

21:14.950 --> 21:18.450
I'm going back to my home
in the Magical World.

21:19.290 --> 21:21.750
Nana must be worried about me,

21:21.750 --> 21:25.400
and when I was watching
you, I thought...

21:28.670 --> 21:30.670
"I should work hard, study hard,

21:30.670 --> 21:32.600
and become a witch like Chocolat!"

21:33.270 --> 21:34.430
Waffle...

21:35.970 --> 21:38.640
And also, I want to make friends.

21:38.640 --> 21:41.020
Friends like Chocolat is to Vanilla.

21:41.020 --> 21:42.110
I see.

21:42.520 --> 21:44.310
I'm sure you can make them.

21:46.730 --> 21:49.620
So just wait for me awhile,
Houx-sama.

21:50.150 --> 21:53.030
S-sure, Waffle.

21:53.030 --> 21:55.150
Come on guys,
let's get a move on.

21:57.820 --> 22:00.330
Waffle, say hi to Nana for us!

22:00.330 --> 22:00.870
Okay!

22:04.110 --> 22:06.920
Vanilla, I will come and save you.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

